 "source": {
  "revision": "DS31898 Rev. 10 - 2, December 2019",
  "pages": 7
 },
 "summary": "A small-signal N-channel enhancement-mode field-effect transistor in the three-lead SOT23 package, rated 50 V drain to source and ±20 V gate to source. On-resistance is at most 1.8 Ω with 10 V on the gate and 2.0 Ω with 4.5 V; the threshold lies between 0.4 V and 1.5 V. It carries 500 mA continuous (1.2 A pulsed) and has 21.8 pF typical input capacitance and 800 pC typical total gate charge. Diodes lists backlighting, DC-DC converters and power management as uses.",
